  refund:'Refunds and cancellation', benPath:'The Pomegranate path, stages 2–5: grammar and original texts', benRefund:'Cancel any time, 14-day refund',
  doc_refund:'<h1 class="pg">Refunds and cancellation</h1><p>Barik Premium offers three plans: Pro Monthly ($12/month), Pro Annual ($59/year — $4.92/month, 59% savings) with auto-renewal, and Heritage Lifetime ($129 one-time payment, no recurring charges).</p><h2>Cancellation</h2><p>You can cancel at any time: “Account” → “Manage subscription”. After you cancel, you are not charged again, and access remains until the end of the paid month.</p><h2>Refunds</h2><p>If the subscription is not for you, write to hello@barik.am within 14 days of a charge — the first one or a renewal — and we will refund that payment in full. No explanation needed; just tell us the email the subscription is registered to.</p><h2>How the refund arrives</h2><p>Refunds are processed by Dodo Payments, the merchant of record that took the payment, to the original payment method. The money usually arrives within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank. After a refund the subscription ends.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Payment questions: hello@barik.am.</p>',
